OL,3,GNEWSANo money for new emergency
OL,4,Adepartment, says minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new emergency department (ED) at
OL,7,FAltnagelvin hospital remains a priority
OL,8,Fproject but there is currently no
OL,9,Ffunding for it, Northern Ireland's
OL,10,Fhealth minister has said.
OL,12,FRobbie Butler, who visited the
OL,13,FLondonderry hospital on Wednesday, said
OL,14,Fa new ED would be "incredibly high on
OL,15,Fthe project list if the money becomes
OL,16,Favailable".
OL,18,FA new ED is one of two Western Health
OL,19,Fand Social Care Trust priority capital
OL,20,Fprojects and has an estimated cost of
OL,21,Faround #73m.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
