OL,3,GNEWSANo money for new emergency
OL,4,Adepartment, says minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FAltnagelvin's emergency department -
OL,7,Fthe oldest one operating
OL,8,Faround-the-clock in Northern Ireland -
OL,9,Fwas designed to treat about 40,000
OL,10,Fpatients a year but is now dealing with
OL,11,Fup to twice that amount.
